      "created": 1761185716,
      "updated": 1761185716
    },
    {
      "id": "68f9902500000000000e8aed",
      "text": "打ったことある作品にアイコン",
      "userId": "65d0d54ba4356b00242d00f4",
      "created": 1761185830,
      "updated": 1761185830
    },
    {
      "id": "68f98fb300000000000e8ad9",
      "text": " [新世紀エヴァンゲリオン][QWOP.icon]",
      "userId": "65d0d54ba4356b00242d00f4",
      "created": 1761185716,
      "updated": 1761185834
    },
    {
      "id": "68f9949000000000000e8b0e",
      "text": " \t親がパチンコ経由で知り、DVDを一緒に観て沼に落ちた[QWOP.icon]",
      "userId": "65d0d54ba4356b00242d00f4",
      "created": 1761186961,
      "updated": 1761187001
    },
    {
      "id": "68f98fcb00000000000e8ade",
      "text": " [交響詩篇エウレカセブン][QWOP.icon]",
      "userId": "65d0d54ba4356b00242d00f4",
      "created": 1761185739,
      "updated": 1761185834
    },
    {
      "id": "68f98fbf00000000000e8adb",
      "text": " [コードギアス][QWOP.icon]",
      "userId": "65d0d54ba4356b00242d00f4",
      "created": 1761185727,
      "updated": 1761185834
    },
    {
      "id": "68f98fc900000000000e8add",
      "text": " [ひぐらしのなく頃に][QWOP.icon]",
      "userId": "65d0d54ba4356b00242d00f4",
      "created": 1761185738,
      "updated": 1761185834
    },
    {
      "id": "68f98fd100000000000e8adf",
      "text": " [百花繚乱サムライガールズ][QWOP.icon]",
      "userId": "65d0d54ba4356b00242d00f4",
      "created": 1761185746,
      "updated": 1761185834
    },
    {
      "id": "68f994d700000000000e8b0f",
      "text": " \t一時期、狂ったように打ってた台の一つ[QWOP.icon]",
      "userId": "65d0d54ba4356b00242d00f4",
      "created": 1761187032,
      "updated": 1761187064
    },
    {
      "id": "68f98fdd00000000000e8ae0",
      "text": " [咲-Saki-][QWOP.icon]",
      "userId": "65d0d54ba4356b00242d00f4",
      "created": 1761185757,
      "updated": 1761185834
    },
    {
      "id": "68f98fb400000000000e8ada",
      "text": " [ギルティクラウン]",
      "userId": "65d0d54ba4356b00242d00f4",
      "created": 1761185716,
      "updated": 1761185834
    },
    {
      "id": "68f9901900000000000e8ae4",
      "text": "　[うみねこのなく頃に]",
      "userId": "67026b2a4d8cae001d9e390a",
      "created": 1761185817,
      "updated": 1761186985
    },
    {
      "id": "68f97cd70000000000be1f65",
      "text": "　　打ったことはないが、非アニメ化範囲の映像化があったりして供給として嬉しい",
      "userId": "67026b2a4d8cae001d9e390a",
      "created": 1761186987,
      "updated": 1761187013
    },
    {
      "id": "68f993f400000000000e8b07",
      "text": "\t[アイドルマスター ミリオンライブ！]",
      "userId": "65d0d54ba4356b00242d00f4",
      "created": 1761186804,
      "updated": 1761187085
    },
    {
      "id": "68f9b655000000000012e727",
      "text": "\t[ソードアート・オンライン]",
      "userId": "65d0d54ba4356b00242d00f4",
      "created": 1761195605,
      "updated": 1761195615
    },
    {
      "id": "68f9950300000000000e8b10",
      "text": "　[ノーゲーム・ノーライフ]",
      "userId": "65d0d54ba4356b00242d00f4",
      "created": 1761187076,
      "updated": 1761195675
    },
    {
      "id": "68f9b69e000000000012e728",
      "text": "　\t[2025/11]リリース",
      "userId": "65d0d54ba4356b00242d00f4",
      "created": 1761195678,
      "updated": 1761195688
    },
    {
      "id": "6a87b2cd0000000000631c32",
      "text": "　[魔法少女まどか☆マギカ]",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1787278029,
      "updated": 1787278035
    },
    {
      "id": "6a87b3cf0000000000631c35",
      "text": "　[機動戦士ガンダムUC]",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1787278287,
      "updated": 1787278287
    },
    {
      "id": "6a87b3930000000000631c33",
      "text": "　[機動戦士ガンダムSEED]",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1787278228,
      "updated": 1787278235
    },
    {
      "id": "6a87b43f0000000000631c38",
      "text": "　[とある魔術の禁書目録]",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1787278399,
      "updated": 1787278399
    },
    {
      "id": "6a87b3fc0000000000631c36",
      "text": "　[とある科学の超電磁砲]",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1787278333,
      "updated": 1787278377
    },
    {
      "id": "6a87b4590000000000631c39",
      "text": "　[北斗の拳]",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1787278426,
      "updated": 1787278431
    },
    {
      "id": "6a87b45f0000000000631c3a",
      "text": "　[蒼天の拳]",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1787278432,
      "updated": 1787278439
    },
    {
      "id": "6a87b4bd0000000000631c3b",
      "text": "　[ToHeart2]",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1787278525,
      "updated": 1787278532
    },
    {
